flowchart TD
    A[Game Starts] --> B{Draw Callback}
    B -->|Hello World| C[Print text via cofont]
    B -->|Shapes| D[Draw shapes + mouse preview]
    B -->|Snake| E[Draw snake + food + score]
    B -->|GUI| F[Draw panel + button]
    F -->|Button pressed| G[OnTap fires]
    G --> H[Print to console]
    B -->|Any game| I{Ctrl+Shift+I?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Show Piscope overlay]
    J -->|Space| K{Paused?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Step with arrows]
    K -->|No| B
    L -->|Right arrow| B
    I -->|No| B